# System Operations & Operation Contracts

## 1. createTask(title, description, priority, dueDate)

**Preconditions:**
- title is not empty

**Postconditions:**
- A new Task is created
- Task is added to the system
- Task status is set to "OPEN"


---

## 2. updateTask(taskId, updatedFields)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists

**Postconditions:**
- Task attributes are updated according to updatedFields


---

## 3. completeTask(taskId)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists
- Task status is not already "COMPLETED"

**Postconditions:**
- Task status is set to "COMPLETED"


---

## 4. cancelTask(taskId)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists
- Task status is not already "CANCELLED"

**Postconditions:**
- Task status is set to "CANCELLED"


---

## 5. addSubtask(taskId, subtaskTitle)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists
- subtaskTitle is not empty

**Postconditions:**
- A new Subtask is created
- Subtask is added to the specified Task


---

## 6. assignProject(taskId, projectId)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists
- Project with projectId exists

**Postconditions:**
- Task is associated with the specified Project


---

## 7. addTag(taskId, tagName)

**Preconditions:**
- Task with taskId exists
- tagName is not empty

**Postconditions:**
- Tag is added to the Task


---

## 8. searchTasks(filters)

**Preconditions:**
- filters are valid

**Postconditions:**
- A list of Tasks matching the filters is returned


---

## 9. exportTasks(format)

**Preconditions:**
- format is supported (e.g., CSV or iCal)

**Postconditions:**
- Tasks are exported in the selected format
